description	"13th Sister (Iskat Akaris)

A sadistic and agile Inquisitor who prefers spree killing.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Inquisitor Lightsaber (Staff/Purple Style Saber)
-- Lifesteal On Hit
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Saber Throw (2)
-- 40 Damage Saber Throw
- Sonic Grenade (1)

^5Force Powers:
- Dark Rage (3) ^3[CS2]
- Speed (1)
-- Speed Lunge
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Jump (3)
- Grip (1)
- Sense (1)

^8Attributes:
